        "text": "Title: Tanya Neurosurgery Report\nDocument Type: NEUROSURGERY_REPORT\nDocument Date: 14/09/2025\nSurgery Date: 14/09/2025\nDocument ID: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-900000000016\nFile URL: synthetic://tanya/neurosurgery-report.pdf",
