      {
        "name": "PATIENT_INFORMATION",
        "heading": "PATIENT INFORMATION",
        "text": "Patient Name: Tanya Bose\nPatient ID: 20000000 -9000-0000-90000-900000000006\nDate of Birth: 1992-12-28 (Age: 32)\nGender: Female\nBlood Group: A-",
        "start": 387,
        "end": 531
      },
      {
        "name": "CLINICAL_TEAM",
        "heading": "CLINICAL TEAM",
        "text": "Primary Surgeon: Dr. Arjun Banerjee, MCh Neurosurgery\nAssisting Surgeon: Dr. Pallavi Sen, MS General Surgery\nAnaesthetist: Dr. Rohan Das, MD Anaesthesiology\nNEUROSURGERY OPERATIVE REPORT\nDate of Surgery: 14 September 2025 (Date of Operation: 14/09/2025)\n*Important Note: Surgery was performed on 14 September 2025.*\nPre-operative Diagnosis: Left frontal intracranial lesion, suspected low-grade glioma\nPost-operative Diagnosis: Left frontal space-occupying lesion (awaiting final\nhistopathology)\nProcedure: Left frontal craniotomy and microsurgical excision of intracranial lesion",
        "start": 544,
        "end": 1126
      },
      {
        "name": "OPERATIVE_SUMMARY",
        "heading": "Operative Summary",
        "text": "* Patient positioned supine with head in Mayfield clamp\n* Left frontal craniotomy performed\n* Dura opened. Lesion identified in the left frontal cortex, well-circumscribed, firm,\ngreyish-white\n* Microsurgical dissection performed. Gross total resection achieved\n* Hemostasis secured. Dura closed in watertight fashion. Bone flap replaced and fixed\n* Estimated blood loss: 180 mL\n* Duration: 3 hours 45 minutes\nSpecimen: Sent for histopathological examination\nIntraoperative Neuromonitoring: No significant changes in somatosensory evoked potentials",
        "start": 1144,
        "end": 1694
      },
      {
        "name": "POSTOPERATIVE_CONDITION",
        "heading": "Immediate Post-operative Condition",
        "text": "* Patient extubated in the OR\n* GCS 15/15\n* ALL four Limbs moving\n* No new neurological deficit\n* Transferred to Neuro-ICU for monitoring",
        "start": 1729,
        "end": 1868
      },
      {
        "name": "POSTOPERATIVE_ORDERS",
        "heading": "Post-operative Orders",
        "text": "* Levetiracetam 500 mg IV BID\n* Dexamethasone 4 mg IV QID (taper over 5 days)\n* Paracetamol 1g IV QID PRN\n* CT Brain within 24 hours post-op\n* Neuro-observations Q1H for 24 hours\nElectronically Signed By:\nDr. Arjun Banerjee, MCh Neurosurgery\n14/09/2025\nMeridian Care Hospital - \"Excellence in Healthcare\"\nPage 1 of 1",
        "start": 1890,
        "end": 2207
      }
